PURPOSE
This is Welliva's master diet knowledge base. Each entry is a special or
therapeutic diet for a specific medical condition, life-stage, or lifestyle.
Meals blend global cuisines (Mediterranean, Western, Asian, Middle-Eastern)
with strong Nigerian / West-African representation so plans feel local and
achievable. Values are typical per-serving estimates for planning, not a
prescription — clinical cases still need a registered dietitian.

Guideline alignment: WHO · AHA · ADA · NHS/NICE · KDOQI · ESPEN · ESC ·
Harvard T.H. Chan · EAT-Lancet · NAFDAC/Nigerian FBDG consensus patterns.

