121. WEIGHT LOSS (EVERYDAY FAT LOSS)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Category : K · Lifestyle & Goal-Based Nutrition
Focus    : A sustainable, moderate calorie deficit built on high protein, high fibre and plenty of vegetables — so you stay full while losing fat steadily.
Best for : Everyday fat loss without crash dieting; slimming down and keeping it off.
Caution  : Aim for ~0.5kg/week, not extreme cuts; keep protein high to protect muscle. Pregnancy & postpartum should NOT run a deficit.
Targets  : ~1500 kcal · Protein ~1.6g/kg · Fibre 30g+ · ~500 kcal/day deficit · Minimal sugary drinks
